## --- Help ---------------------------------------------------
psc.help.header=§e--- Survival Core: help ---
psc.help.tree=§7TreeCapitator: §fbreak a log with an axe§7. Sneak to fell one log. Buildings made of logs are left alone.
psc.help.vein=§7VeinMiner: §fbreak an ore with a pickaxe§7. Sneak to mine one block. Silk Touch and Fortune apply to the whole vein.
psc.help.clump=§7Clumping: §fthe drops of a felled tree or a mined vein are merged into full stacks.
psc.help.light=§7Dynamic light: §fhold a torch, a lantern, a lava bucket... §7and it lights around you.
psc.help.commands=§7Commands: §f/scriptevent psc:diag, psc:tree, psc:light, psc:cleanlight

